  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">항상 재과만에서 많은 정보와 아이디어를 얻고 있어요. 정말 감사합니다.<br>다른 선생님이 했던 게임을 활용해서 2학년 대상 게임을 만들어봤어요.<br>별거 아니고 작은 간식이여도 아이들은 정말 열심히 게임에 참여하네요.<br>다른 선생님에게 도움이 될까 게임 공유합니다.ㅎ</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/da2f5e15ad04ad4afe3cd0c8110b310245441f40\" data-file-name=\"Let’s Science Game.pdf\" data-file-size=\"140715\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHw%26dataid%3D221%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20240710201010&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fda2f5e15ad04ad4afe3cd0c8110b310245441f40')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">Let’s Science Game</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">137.42KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">파일 뒷부분은 실험테이블 위에 놓는 게임안내판입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d969f7a86c420b4840e659d925de391696c42191\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d969f7a86c420b4840e659d925de391696c42191\" data-origin-width=\"4000\" data-origin-height=\"3000\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9f02f925011b3bb27dc42835ac85269655ed7e19\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9f02f925011b3bb27dc42835ac85269655ed7e19\" data-origin-width=\"4000\" data-origin-height=\"3000\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d49b0f0c1568053532315a95047fa241f5ed5a15\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t